            "body": "Heads-up: #29214 (merged 2026-06-25) removed `SenderWrapper` and moved the stamping into `tokenizer_manager.stamp_http_worker_ipc()`, so this PR patches code that no longer exists\r\non main and needs a rebase to fix the new location (`[ipc_name] * len(obj.rids)` with\r\n`rids=None` on `BatchTokenizedGenerateReqInput`).\r\n\r\nAlso raises the stakes for landing it: the default server warmup takes the batched path,\r\nso on current builds `--tokenizer-worker-num > 1` fails at startup out of the box unless\r\n`--skip-server-warmup` is set. Details + traceback in\r\nhttps://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/29024#issuecomment-4866561099",
